cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use merge-multisample-vcf in your research, please cite this software.
type: software
title: merge-multisample-vcf
abstract: Snakemake workflow for normalizing and merging large multi-sample VCF cohorts with bcftools. Two-stage batching merges normalized inputs into batch VCFs and then a cohort-wide VCF, with recalculated variant annotations, tabix indexes, and MD5 checksums.
version: 0.2.0
date-released: '2026-02-18'
url: https://github.com/scholl-lab/merge-multisample-vcf
repository-code: https://github.com/scholl-lab/merge-multisample-vcf
license: MIT
keywords:
